{"title":"검역창궁","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=PtXIP/hzXanpxTSj/RgBH7LfZukwST5ufTtYVoK&filename=th3","synopsis":"현천의 아버지는 명문세가의 장남이다. 그러나 사리사욕에 눈이 먼 동생의 음모와 배신으로 집안에서 쫓겨난 것은 물론 자객의 습격을 받아 목숨까지 위협 받는데... 그날부터 부모님을 위해 삼촌을 향한 복수를 다짐한 현천, 본격적으로 검도의 길에 들어서는데 실력은 생각만큼 늘지 않는다. \n그러던 어느 날, 우연한 기회에 마주한 검영(劍影)으로 인해 실력이 증폭되는데... \n순진했던 소년에서 최강 검신(劍神)이 되기까지, 소년의 끝없는 모험이 시작된다!!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":242,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":256,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":183,"change":{"type":"up","amount":73}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":122,"change":{"type":"up","amount":61}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":261,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":190,"change":{"type":"up","amount":71}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":171,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":237,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":295,"change":{"type":"down","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":189,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":117,"change":{"type":"up","amount":72}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":125,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":148,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":148,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":156,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":170,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":158,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":140,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":170,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":162,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":248,"chan